DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup of musicians that will be performi
 ng live right here at the farm! Join us on select Friday evenings and Satu
 rdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. Mackenzie Paige is or
 iginally from a farm in Lancaster\, Pennsylvania. She was raised in a very
  musical family\, and began songwriting and performing at a young age. She
  went on to study music at Messiah University. Mackenzie was blessed to sp
 end a semester of college at the Contemporary Music Center in Nashville\, 
 Tennessee. She has gleaned from artists such as Norah Jones\, Miranda Lamb
 ert\, and Natalie Hemby. She is a lover of all music\, but country has sto
 len her heart\, and feels like home. Additional Fun Things To Do in Lancas
